{
  "bodyHash": "kr0hYPNpTno=",
  "content": "<h1 style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">適用於 Minecraft Java 版原版版本：<strong><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">1.21.11</span></strong></span></h1><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">歡迎來到<strong><span style=\"color:#72b990\">《不死地下城》</span></strong>，這是我們最新（也希望能成為最棒）的殭屍生存 Minecraft 地圖，距離前作<span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\"><a style=\"color:#c2e0f4\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fproject%252fkein-entkommen-open-beta%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">《無處可逃》</a></span>已時隔三年。在精心打造的環境中穿梭、探索並善用地形優勢，對抗成群的不死生物，將裝備從簡陋的木劍逐步升級成你理想中的配置。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">隨著遊戲進展，你會發現殭屍將開始揮舞武器、裝備護甲，並擁有獨特能力，足以扭轉戰局。然而，你最好別讓這股無情的攻勢壓垮；與朋友組隊武裝，或獨自深入，準備不惜一切代價征服這永無止境的威脅！</span></p><h2 style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#ced4d9;font-size:18px\">遊戲特色</span><br></span></h2><ul style=\"text-align:left\">\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">一套<strong>沉浸式積分系統</strong>，擊殺殭屍可賺取點數。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">一套<strong>引人入勝的連擊系統</strong>，可根據擊殺數修復裝備。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>成群的不死敵人</strong>，會隨著遊戲進度<strong>逐漸提升挑戰性</strong>。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">實驗與協同效應，從<strong>100 多種獨特武器與裝備</strong>中自由選擇。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>多種增益效果</strong>，每種皆可升級以強化效果。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">自訂功能，透過升級站<strong>隨心所欲調整裝備</strong>。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>多樣化的環境</strong>，各具獨特危險與優勢。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">策略運用，透過地圖中散布的<strong>各種陷阱</strong>智取敵人！</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">試試手氣，我們改良了過往的「效果增幅器」——<strong>神龕系統</strong>。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>可選擇的難度等級</strong>，讓你決定適合的遊玩強度。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>隱藏彩蛋</strong>，最終將面對<strong>強大的頭目戰</strong>！</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">合作模式，支援<strong>最多 4 名玩家</strong>。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">以上所有內容<strong>＋更多驚喜！</strong></span></li>\n</ul><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">無論你只是瀏覽下載頁面，或想試玩此地圖，我們都衷心感謝。本地圖耗費我們數年開發，希望每個細節都能讓你感受到這份心血！</span></p><h2 style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:#ced4d9\">地圖製作名單</span></span></h2><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">地圖設計 — <span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><a style=\"color:#b96ad9\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fmember%252fjondly\" rel=\"nofollow\">Jondly (Cool29374)</a></span><br>地圖功能 — <span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><a style=\"color:#2dc26b\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fmember%252fhman185\" rel=\"nofollow\">UncleZestoid (Hman185)</a></span></span></p><h2 style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:#ced4d9\">無版權音樂來源</span></span></span></span></h2><p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=lPTYPspnq8Q\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">[Chiptune] Medieval: The Bard's Tale (CC0) Full Track + Loop</a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3TMBF4zq4LQ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">[Chiptune] Medieval: The Old Tower Inn (CC0) Full Track + Loop</a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=eJs_qShUo1E\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">[Chiptune] Medieval: Minstrel Dance (CC0) Full Track + Loop</a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=k62Ou2aBrI0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">z3r0 - 8bit Nightmare | 8bit Horror - NO COPYRIGHT MUSIC</a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Ta_CfawmaUg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">z3r0 - Polybius | 8bit Horror - COPYRIGHT FREE MUSIC</a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=SCSep3aqlxw\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">z3r0 - Transient | 80s + 8bit Horror music - COPYRIGHT FREE MUSIC</a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=eP-S3KrBbdc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">z3r0 - Sleepwalker | Prog Horror - COPYRIGHT FREE MUSIC</a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WSCkIafTNfM\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">8 bits scary melody.</a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BXgY7gBiU0E\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Epic Retro 8-bit Music | Scifi/Fantasy Chiptune Theme | Mario/Sonic/Bomberman/Metroid/Shovel Knight - YouTube</a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ul4DEqFWBfU\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">🎃👾[FREE] 8 - Bit Halloween Retro Spooky Chip Tunes Lo Fi Reshape Project - Royalty Free Music 💣🎃</a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1IJiXtPkLJY\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Old ROBLOX Horror Music but 8-bit</a><br><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZF-CPF_Ndm4&amp;list=PLtkjJsGOW8yPVOauP48WCyeq7KARWxD7r\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Water Level Music 🌊🕹️ - \"Sunken Heart City\"</a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=28dbNKUz7QI\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">z3r0 - 8bit Syndrome | 8bit Horror - COPYRIGHT FREE MUSIC</a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=gOCdw4v0t00\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">[FREE FOR PROFIT] 8 bit horror type beat \"NES JASON\" | prod. nakavelli</a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Iv2UETYwJ7w\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">8-Bit Horror Game Soundtrack - Both Sides Of The Screen</a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IPlldLhH19k\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Anticipation(Dark chiptune Free to use)</a></p>",
